{"id":41185,"date":"2025-03-19T10:19:53","date_gmt":"2025-03-19T09:19:53","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-de-sevilha-2026\/"},"modified":"2026-09-19T17:10:56","modified_gmt":"2026-09-19T16:10:56","slug":"maratona-de-sevilha","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-de-sevilha\/","title":{"rendered":"Maratona de Sevilha 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Maratona de Sevilha 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Zurich Maratona de Sevilha 2027<\/strong> (42\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no domingo, <strong>21 de Fevereiro de 2027<\/strong>, na ensolarada capital da Andaluzia, em <strong>Sevilha, Espanha<\/strong>. Reconhecida internacionalmente como o percurso mais plano da Europa com apenas 10 metros de desn\u00edvel e distinguida com o prestigiado selo <strong>World Athletics Gold Label<\/strong>, a prova re\u00fane 20.000 maratonistas e atrai anualmente milhares de atletas portugueses \u00e0 procura de novos recordes pessoais e \u00edndices de qualifica\u00e7\u00e3o internacional.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com organiza\u00e7\u00e3o a cargo do <strong>Instituto Municipal de Deportes de Sevilla<\/strong> em parceria com a <strong>Sport Life Ib\u00e9rica \/ Motorpress<\/strong>, a prova de <strong>42.195 metros<\/strong> tem partida na <strong>Avenida de Mar\u00eda Luisa<\/strong> e meta no ic\u00f3nico <strong>Paseo de las Delicias<\/strong>. O tra\u00e7ado urbano, totalmente protegido do vento e sem desn\u00edveis acentuados, atravessa o cora\u00e7\u00e3o hist\u00f3rico da cidade, incluindo passagens emblem\u00e1ticas pela Plaza de Espa\u00f1a, Torre del Oro, Real Maestranza, muralhas da Macarena e a imponente Catedral com a Giralda.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">21 de Fevereiro de 2027<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Avenida de Mar\u00eda Luisa e Paseo de las Delicias, Sevilha, Espanha<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">42.195 km e 5 km Breakfast Run<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Instituto Municipal de Deportes de Sevilla e Sport Life Ib\u00e9rica<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tempo Limite (Cut-off)<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">6h00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Regulamento Oficial<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.zurichmaratonsevilla.es\/zms-reglamento\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\"><br \/>\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Abrir Regulamento Oficial (PDF) &rarr;<br \/>\n                <\/a><\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Maratona<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Zurich Marat\u00f3n de Sevilla<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 21 Fev \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 08:30<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">82,10 \u20ac<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida de Estrada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Breakfast Run<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 20 Fev \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando se realiza a Maratona de Sevilha 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova principal realiza-se no domingo, 21 de Fevereiro de 2027, com partida marcada para as 08h30 na Avenida de Mar\u00eda Luisa e encerramento da meta \u00e0s 15h00 no Paseo de las Delicias, em Sevilha.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Por que raz\u00e3o o percurso de Sevilha \u00e9 considerado o mais plano da Europa?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O tra\u00e7ado apresenta uma diferen\u00e7a de apenas 10 metros entre o ponto mais baixo e o mais alto de toda a corrida, curvas muito suaves ao n\u00edvel do mar e excelente abrigo de vento, tornando-o no cen\u00e1rio de elei\u00e7\u00e3o mundial para bater recordes pessoais nos 42.195 km.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite (cut-off) para concluir a maratona?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O tempo limite oficial \u00e9 de 6 horas a contar da partida do \u00faltimo pelot\u00e3o de atletas, fechando a linha de meta impreterivelmente \u00e0s 15h00.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde se realiza o levantamento de dorsais e a Expo Marathon?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A Feira do Corredor (Expo Marathon) decorre na sexta-feira e s\u00e1bado anteriores \u00e0 prova no Pal\u00e1cio de Exposi\u00e7\u00f5es e Congressos FIBES de Sevilha, local onde todos os atletas devem retirar o dorsal e o saco oficial.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar o regulamento oficial e efetuar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais e o regulamento normativo completo est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis no portal oficial da organiza\u00e7\u00e3o em www.zurichmaratonsevilla.es.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Maratona de Sevilha 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-02-21\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Avenida de Mar\u00eda Luisa e Paseo de las Delicias, Sevilha\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Sevilha\", \"addressRegion\": \"Espanha\", \"addressCountry\": \"ES\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Instituto Municipal de Deportes de Sevilla e Sport Life Ib\u00e9rica\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando se realiza a Maratona de Sevilha 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova principal realiza-se no domingo, 21 de Fevereiro de 2027, com partida marcada para as 08h30 na Avenida de Mar\u00eda Luisa e encerramento da meta \u00e0s 15h00 no Paseo de las Delicias, em Sevilha.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Por que raz\u00e3o o percurso de Sevilha \u00e9 considerado o mais plano da Europa?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O tra\u00e7ado apresenta uma diferen\u00e7a de apenas 10 metros entre o ponto mais baixo e o mais alto de toda a corrida, curvas muito suaves ao n\u00edvel do mar e excelente abrigo de vento, tornando-o no cen\u00e1rio de elei\u00e7\u00e3o mundial para bater recordes pessoais nos 42.195 km.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite (cut-off) para concluir a maratona?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O tempo limite oficial \u00e9 de 6 horas a contar da partida do \u00faltimo pelot\u00e3o de atletas, fechando a linha de meta impreterivelmente \u00e0s 15h00.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde se realiza o levantamento de dorsais e a Expo Marathon?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A Feira do Corredor (Expo Marathon) decorre na sexta-feira e s\u00e1bado anteriores \u00e0 prova no Pal\u00e1cio de Exposi\u00e7\u00f5es e Congressos FIBES de Sevilha, local onde todos os atletas devem retirar o dorsal e o saco oficial.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso consultar o regulamento oficial e efetuar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais e o regulamento normativo completo est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis no portal oficial da organiza\u00e7\u00e3o em www.zurichmaratonsevilla.es.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66356,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,478,31],"event_type_2":[809,627],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-41185","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-sevilha-espanha","event_type-corrida","event_type-corridas-inferior-10","event_type-maratona","event_type_2-espanha","event_type_2-europa"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/maratona-de-sevilha-2027.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/41185","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=41185"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/41185\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":67668,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2